\[
\vec{a} \cdot \vec{b} = 1 \cdot (-2) + 2 \cdot 3 + (-2) \cdot m = -2 + 6 - 2m
\]
Setting this equal to zero, we can solve for \(m\):
\[
-2 + 6 - 2m = 0
\]
</think>
<python>
